<title>TUNISIA: Tunis Treasury raises 65 million dinars in T-bills.</title>
<headline>Tunis Treasury raises 65 million dinars in T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised 65 million dinars in treasury bills at its weekly auction and repaid maturing paper totalling 59.8 million dinars.</p>
<p>It sold 52-week paper at a 6.8750 percent coupon rate for an amount of two million dinars, and at 6.9375 percent for 63 million dinars.</p>
<p>Banks bid for 276 million dinars for 52-week, two and five-year paper at between 6.8750 and 8.0625 percent. ($ = 1.09 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538 REUTER SBK/wb</p>
